  <!-- 4. FAQ -->
  <section class="ac-faq">
    <h2 class="ac-faq-h">Questions <em>answered</em>.</h2>

    {%- if product.handle == 'alley-cats-bong' or product.handle == 'alley-cats-xl-bong' -%}
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <button class="ac-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What joint size does it use?<span class="ac-faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="ac-faq-a" aria-hidden="true">14mm female joint — any standard 14mm male bowl fits. A bowl is included.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <button class="ac-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Does it have a percolator?<span class="ac-faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="ac-faq-a" aria-hidden="true">{%- if product.handle == 'alley-cats-xl-bong' -%}Yes — an engineered percolation system built into the body. More water volume means smoother, more filtered draws than the standard size.{%- else -%}Yes — built-in percolation for smoother, filtered draws. You'll feel the difference vs. a straight tube.{%- endif -%}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <button class="ac-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much water do I add?<span class="ac-faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="ac-faq-a" aria-hidden="true">Fill until water just covers the bottom of the downstem — about an inch above the slits. Too little kills filtration. Too much and it splashes. Do a test pull before lighting.</div>
      </div>
      {%- if product.handle == 'alley-cats-xl-bong' -%}
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <button class="ac-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much bigger is the XL vs. the standard?<span class="ac-faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="ac-faq-a" aria-hidden="true">Roughly 14–16" vs. 9". Significantly more water volume, a bigger draw, and more presence. It's the one that anchors a setup.</div>
      </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- elsif product.handle == 'alley-cats-hand-pipe' -%}
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <button class="ac-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Does it have a carb hole?<span class="ac-faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="ac-faq-a" aria-hidden="true">Yes — standard side carb. Cover while you inhale, release to clear.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <button class="ac-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Any packing tips?<span class="ac-faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="ac-faq-a" aria-hidden="true">Grind medium-fine. Don't pack too tight — you need airflow. A light thumb tamp is enough. Overpacking kills the draw.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ac-faq-item">
        <button class="ac-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What comes in the box?<span class="ac-faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="ac-faq-a" aria-hidden="true">Just the pipe. It's self-contained — no separate bowl or downstem needed.</div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="ac-faq-item">
      <button class="ac-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How do I clean it?<span class="ac-faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="ac-faq-a" aria-hidden="true">{%- if product.handle == 'alley-cats-hand-pipe' -%}Isopropyl alcohol (90%+) and coarse salt in a zip-lock bag. Seal, shake for a minute, rinse with warm water.{%- else -%}Isopropyl alcohol (90%+) and coarse salt. Pour in, cap the openings, shake for 30–60 seconds, rinse with warm water. Repeat if needed. Always rinse thoroughly before use.{%- endif -%}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-faq-item">
      <button class="ac-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is the glass actually borosilicate?<span class="ac-faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="ac-faq-a" aria-hidden="true">Yes. Borosilicate is harder, more heat-resistant, and more durable than soft glass — the same material used in lab glassware. We don't carry soft glass.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-faq-item">
